# The Lunar Whale ({3}{U}, 3/5 flying Vehicle, crew 1): "As long as The Lunar Whale attacked this turn, you may play the top card of your
# library." Bot1 casts it on turn 1 with Black Lotus and Mox Sapphire, and a Memnite. On turn 3 the Ornithopter on top of its library cannot
# be cast from there, not before the Whale is crewed and not after, until it is declared as an attacker. In the second main phase it may
# be cast from the top (it costs {0}), and then the Island that is next on top is played from the library: its land play for the turn.

